{#- The control part of a suite (docs/SCE_TEST_PROFILE.md §9.2 E15, §9.5;
    ES 201 873-1 §26.1, §26.2): each test case in the suite's order, executed
    with its guard in seconds as the second argument where it has one, inside
    an `if` over the features' module parameters where the suite selects it.
    `control` is `ttcn3_export::execution::ControlView`. -#}
control {
{% for e in control.executes %}
{% if e.condition %}
  if ({{ e.condition }}) {
    execute({{ e.test_case }}(){% if e.guard %}, {{ e.guard }}{% endif %});
  }
{% else %}
  execute({{ e.test_case }}(){% if e.guard %}, {{ e.guard }}{% endif %});
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
}
